message: "Please cite this compilation and the underlying providers used in your analysis; see docs/SOURCES_AND_REUSE.md."
type: dataset
title: "Czech Lands Historical GIS"
version: 0.6.1
date-released: 2026-11-04
authors:
  - family-names: Dittrich
    given-names: Adam
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7803-1339"
url: "https://adamdittrich.github.io/czech-lands-historical-gis.html"
repository-code: "https://github.com/adamdittrich/adamdittrich.github.io/tree/main/assets/files/datasets/historical-gis"
abstract: >-
  A collection of historical census, election, climate and derived geographical
  data for the Czech lands, with 330 judicial districts of 1930 as its principal
  geography. Four historical administrative geographies, source-specific dates,
  dictionaries, quality flags and explicit component reuse terms are retained.
keywords:
  - historical GIS
  - Czech lands
  - economic history
  - interwar Czechoslovakia
  - historical districts
